WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.230
- Speaking of his fans though,

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:04.269
this happened recently at one
of Matt's shows, watch this.

00:00:04.269 --> 00:00:08.979
- [Audience Member] And she
had wanted you to figure out-

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:10.275
- Oh! (beep)

00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:11.108
- [Audience Member] The original way.

00:00:11.108 --> 00:00:13.920
- Yo, can we get a paramedic
real quick, paramedic please.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.926
You okay?

00:00:14.926 --> 00:00:15.850
[Audience Member 2] Oh, she's gonna cry.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.090
- [Matt] Are you all right?

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:19.790
You feeling okay, you promise?

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:20.623
- [Audience Member 3] Can
I get a picture with you?

00:00:20.623 --> 00:00:22.710
- Yeah, of course,

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.860
just don't use it for
the obituary, my God.

00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:26.824
(audience cheering)

00:00:26.824 --> 00:00:27.833
- The best line, what happened?

00:00:31.661 --> 00:00:35.250
- Well, she's okay, she's fine.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.810
- Which is why the joke is funny.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:37.950
- Oh, of course, of course.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.060
No, we wouldn't have continued the show

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:40.710
if some tragic (beep) happened.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.953
Like, somebody get her outta
here, I gotta plug merch.

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.319
(audience laughing)

00:00:48.319 --> 00:00:49.947
Cut, cut, rewind it.

00:00:49.947 --> 00:00:51.090
- [Kelly] That's amazing.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:54.000
- This was probably 25 minutes

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.920
into one of our headlining shows.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.660
And I hear this commotion

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.600
and I look down and I
could see she's convulsing.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.850
So I immediately, once I
recognized what was happening,

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:04.770
I called for anybody being
a paramedic in the room

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:06.510
and luckily the people at the venue,

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:08.100
and people who do work
in the medical field

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.680
that were in the audience
rush to her side immediately.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.840
I have to leave the
stage when that happens,

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:13.710
so that I can be informed

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.120
as to what's going on

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.680
while she's getting tended to properly.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:17.513
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:17.513 --> 00:01:18.346
- And not in anybody's way.

00:01:18.346 --> 00:01:20.640
And it was like seven
or eight minutes later,

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.340
I would say, my security
came back and was like,

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.310
hey, she wants to stay.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.380
And I was like, I'll give her a refund.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:30.390
Like she doesn't have to stay.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.680
But she, I went out there and I was like,

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:33.180
lemme just go talk to her,
make sure she's all right.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.013
And I walked out

00:01:34.013 --> 00:01:35.400
and the first thing I said
was like, are you okay?

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.490
She was like, yeah, can I have a picture?

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:40.743
I was like, yeah, no flash.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:46.440
She had epilepsy, what a
wild thing to ask first, man.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.650
But you gotta respect
the passion, you know?

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:50.483
She wanted to stay.

00:01:50.483 --> 00:01:51.604
She had to, you know, carpe diem.

00:01:51.604 --> 00:01:54.402
- But the thing is comedy
makes people happy.

00:01:54.402 --> 00:01:55.235
- [Matt] Oh, of course.

00:01:55.235 --> 00:01:56.068
- You make people happy,
you make people laugh.

00:01:56.068 --> 00:01:56.901
I forgot this,

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:57.990
and I went to a show here
recently in New York,

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:00.443
and it made me feel so good
to get out and just laugh.

00:02:00.443 --> 00:02:01.403
- [Al] With other people.

00:02:01.403 --> 00:02:02.236
- Yes.

00:02:02.236 --> 00:02:03.069
- Oh, absolutely, you have no idea.

00:02:03.069 --> 00:02:03.902
It brings people together

00:02:03.902 --> 00:02:04.770
to such an extreme level.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.720
You think it's just random jokes

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:08.040
that you're just telling
to make people happy.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.870
- [Kelly] No we're all
connecting in a different way.

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:10.800
- Yeah, absolutely,

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.950
she was such a good
sport about everything.

